      "content": "hey my husband had the flu last week and he's mostly better but his fever is back up to 103 today and he's got a really bad headache. he's acting a bit weird too, like he's kind of slow to respond and seems confused when i talk to him. do u think i should just give him more tylenol or should i be worried about him going to the er? it's probably just the flu lingering right?",
